steam_community_announcements/1846651706691671","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5052860-1846651706672859","game_id":"steam-5052860","kind":"announcement","title":"🚗 3,000+ Wishlists & Our New Trailer!","summary":"Hello, Collectors!Supercar Collection Together has passed 3,000 wishlists on Steam! Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted the game, shared it with friends, and supported us along the way. Our community keeps growing, and we’re excited to share this journey with you!To celebrate, we have something new to show you: our latest trailer is here!🎬 Watch Our New TrailerTake a fresh look at Supercar Collection Together and get ready to build your own diecast store with friends!🏁 Build Your Collection","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:11:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672859","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5052860-1846018067937535","game_id":"steam-5052860","kind":"announcement","title":"✨ Supercar Collection Together Devlog #3 - Apex Series & Improvements","summary":"Hey collectors! 👋 We’ve been busy working on Supercar Collection Together! In Devlog #3, we’re sharing a new car series, visual updates, and improvements to the co-op diecast store experience, along with a look at our plans before launch.🏎️ Meet the Apex Series! The Apex Series has joined our Supercar lineup, bringing new diecast models to add to your collection.And there’s more to come! We’ll be adding more car series as we build a whole new Supercar collection exclusive to Supercar Collection ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T00:10:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937535","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5052860-1846018067928021","game_id":"steam-5052860","kind":"announcement","title":"🏎️ Supercar Collection Together - Play the Demo NOW","summary":"Hello, CollectorsThe wait is over! The DEMO for Supercar Collection Together is OUT NOW! 🔥Grab your friends and get ready to run your own diecast store! Open surprise car packs, fill your shelves, build your collection, and challenge each other on the racing track.Play solo or team up in 1 - 4 player online co-op and get your first taste of life as a Supercar store owner! 🏪What Can You Do in Supercar Collection Together?👥 Run your store with friends Share the work! While one player handles the c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T01:43:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928021","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5052860-1845383656386369","game_id":"steam-5052860","kind":"announcement","title":"🛠️ Supercar Collection Together - Devlog #2","summary":"A Big Thank You to Our Closed Beta Testers!Our closed beta has been a huge help in shaping Supercar Collection Together. Many players joined us, tested the game, shared feedback, and helped us spot issues along the way. A big thank you to everyone who took the time to play and send us their thoughts 🙌With your help, we’ve fixed more than 50 bugs during this testing period. The game is getting closer to a more playable and polished version, and your feedback continues to guide our development. 💪✨","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T13:37:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386369","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5052860-1844751498234658","game_id":"steam-5052860","kind":"announcement","title":"🏎️ Supercar Collection Together Launches November 9!","summary":"Hello, collectors!Get ready to open your store! Supercar Collection Together launches on Steam on November 9, 2026.Run your own diecast model car store solo or team up with friends in 1–4 player online co-op to build your dream collection together.📦 Open surprise boxes: Discover different Supercar series, hunt for rare models, and find the missing pieces of your collection.🤝 Share the work: One player stocks the shelves while another serves customers. Handle orders, inventory, and daily store ta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:40:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234658","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5052860-1844115010488858","game_id":"steam-5052860","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉🎉 WE REACHED 1,000 WISHLISTS IN JUST 5 DAYS! 🏎️🏎️","summary":"👋 Hello, collectors!We’re thrilled to announce that Supercar Collection Together has surpassed 1,000 Steam wishlists in just five days! 🚀A huge thank you to everyone who added the game to their wishlist, shared it with friends, and supported us from the very first day of its announcement. 🙌As a small indie team, reaching our first milestone so quickly has made us even more motivated! 💪✨ WHAT’S NEW IN SUPERCAR COLLECTION TOGETHER? ✨Supercar Collection Together expands the collection and store man","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:38:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_onl